/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (This report aims to develop a strategy for restoring Kimchi Blue, one of Urban Outfitter's proprietary labels. The strategywill address challenges while staying aligned with the brand's ethos of creativity and connecting with Gen Z through subcultures, style tribes, and music. Insights from competitor analysis and market research in the UK and Germany will inform the approach. Additionally, the report will examine Kimchi Blue's brand identity and positioning, and explore sustainability and price sensitivity to ensure the brand remains relevant and appealing to consumers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
