/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (Their fast-fashion model enables them to quickly respond to social media trends, adding hundreds of new items daily and dominating platforms like TikTok, where they have a 42% percentage of #hauls content for Shein \(Modern Retail 2023\). Also, their supply chain plays a big role here too. Shein and Temu's dominance in e-commerce stems from their fast supply chains, taking advantage of manufacturing proximity, vendor networks, and optimised logistics for unmatched speed, efficiency, and cost-effectiveness. This allows them to swiftly turn social media trends into affordable, diverse products, leaving competitors struggling to adapt their models to this new standard \(Scmr 2023\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
